before things went bad.

509
00:38:02.192 --> 00:38:03.716
people started to change
for the better.

510
00:38:04.194 --> 00:38:07.633
Not all people.
Some people can't change.

511
00:38:08.198 --> 00:38:10.200
Those are the people you'll have
the judges and the lawyers

512
00:38:10.331 --> 00:38:11.245
and the wardens for.

513
00:38:11.680 --> 00:38:15.771
You're wrong.

514
00:38:20.298 --> 00:38:21.168
I guess we'll find out.

515
00:38:43.669 --> 00:38:45.192
From the beginning.

516
00:38:45.279 --> 00:38:47.194
all you've been doing is tryin'
to keep this place a secret.

517
00:38:47.716 --> 00:38:50.545
The red lights. the cameras.
the window panels...

518
00:38:51.329 --> 00:38:52.895
- I know.
- You said that if

519
00:38:53.026 --> 00:38:54.288
