about this place.

520
00:38:54.419 --> 00:38:55.898
they would kill us all
to try to steal it.

521
00:38:56.377 --> 00:38:57.335
I know.

522
00:38:57.813 --> 00:38:59.075
Okay. So has
any of that changed?

523
00:38:59.511 --> 00:39:02.122
Those people would kill us
all to try to steal it.

524
00:39:02.644 --> 00:39:04.167
And that is
why we need more people.

525
00:39:04.298 --> 00:39:07.345
We need enough people to be
able to fight back all comers.

526
00:39:07.910 --> 00:39:09.999
We do what you're proposing
and bad people could

527
