530
00:39:17.398 --> 00:39:19.400
Anybody comin' across
this river. we can see 'em.

531
00:39:19.748 --> 00:39:22.969
With our armory. we're gonna
be more prepared than they are.

532
00:39:23.361 --> 00:39:25.275
