533
00:39:26.364 --> 00:39:28.801
This is the best that any
of us have ever had it. Maggie.

534
00:39:28.888 --> 00:39:30.455
We have a pantry full of food.

535
00:39:30.542 --> 00:39:33.196
A pantry that is getting less
and less full every single day

536
00:39:33.849 --> 00:39:35.068
