get the most desperate.

539
00:39:39.638 --> 00:39:41.335
Desperate people
are the most dangerous.

540
00:39:41.814 --> 00:39:43.076
We bring in more people.

541
00:39:44.512 --> 00:39:46.166
we can start
plowing Central Park.

542
00:39:46.688 --> 00:39:48.864
