543
00:39:48.951 --> 00:39:50.866
A hospital that is only
as good as its doctors.

544
00:39:50.997 --> 00:39:52.085
We've got one doctor.

545
00:39:52.694 --> 00:39:54.000
God forbid
anything should happen

546
