to Luis before he starts
trainin' some more people.

547
00:39:56.655 --> 00:39:59.919
These people coming across.
we could have more doctors.

548
00:40:00.049 --> 00:40:01.355
Okay look.
I get what you're saying. I do.

549
00:40:01.486 --> 00:40:03.009
I understand your argument.

550
00:40:03.139 --> 00:40:07.056
